# Guacamole

Based on [https://www.mexicoinmykitchen.com/guacamole-recipe](https://www.mexicoinmykitchen.com/guacamole-recipe) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250131083018/https://www.mexicoinmykitchen.com/guacamole-recipe)). Previously based on [https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/…](https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/perfect_guacamole) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250817121340/https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/perfect_guacamole))

{ rating="5" image="guacamole.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 6 [ripe avocados]{ ing="ripe-avocados" }, mashed
- [ ] 1/4 cup [minced red onion]{ ing="minced-red-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 1/4 cup [tomatoes]{ ing="tomatoes" }, diced
- [ ] [Serrano pepper]{ ing="serrano-pepper" }, diced
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }, finely chopped
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Kosher salt]{ ing="kosher-salt" }
- [ ] 1.5 [limes]{ ing="limes" }, juiced
- [ ] [Serve with sturdy chips]{ ing="serve-with-sturdy-chips" }, such as Tostitos

## Recipe

1. Cut the [avocados]{ ing="ripe-avocados" } in half, remove the core, then scoop out the flesh with a spoon in one pass. Mash with a fork until only some chunks remain
1. Mix in the pico de gallo
